+@Athanasius325 / Fr James OK thanks -  so reception is about transmission rather than duration - it came down to us rather than something we introduced ourselves.
+
+Does "at least in the West" mean something can be received in one tradition and not another? Or is there a level where something counts as received by the church as a whole?
+
